       "id": "14fa3f1e",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">Namotu Island is Fiji’s world class destination for water and sports experiences with easy access to Fiji’s premiere surf breaks. Beau in conjunction with Pepper Productions has produced many different videos promoting the island and services. Although an amazing island in a beautiful setting it is a difficult environment to shoot in due to dealing with the elements. Shooting from the water, in the water, land based and with drones the equipment gets abused.</p>",
