     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">The Fiji Dentist Documentary has been a massive production from start to finish. Our Pepper crew spent two weeks in Fiji capturing the group of American dentists as they gave up their time to help with the dental and medical needs in a remote part of Fiji. Follow their journey and discover how their whole operation runs.</p>",
